/Alt (A bar chart titled "Model Performance by Category on 632 Cyber Tasks" compares the percentage of tasks correctly solved by six AI models across six categories: Cryptography \(n=209\), Digital Forensics \(n=39\), Miscellaneous \(n=74\), Binary Exploitation \(n=148\), Reverse Engineering \(n=122\), and Web Security \(n=40\). The models are OpenAI GPT-5, Anthropic Opus 4, OpenAI gpt-oss, DeepSeek V3.1, DeepSeek R1-0528, and DeepSeek R1. Each category shows varying performance levels, with OpenAI GPT-5 generally performing highest, especially in Cryptography \(around 65%\) and Web Security \(around 65%\), while DeepSeek models show lower performance, particularly in Binary Exploitation \(below 10%\) and Reverse Engineering \(below 10% for R1\). Error bars indicate variability in the data.␀)
